# Per-row model outputs. Regenerated by `make train`. Unlike the aggregate
# metrics CSVs, they are row-level derivatives of datasets whose redistribution
# rights are unresolved (see data/README.md). Committing 284,807 scored rows of a
# possibly-ODbL database is exactly the derived database share-alike attaches to.
reports/*_oof_predictions.csv
reports/*_test_predictions.csv

# Data (regenerated via scripts)
data/raw/*
data/processed/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# Model checkpoints (regenerated via training)
checkpoints/*/

